 6. Full circle 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 Thomas Novelly during a 2024 Pentagon press briefing. Screenshot: Defense Department 

 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 🔭 One of the first Space Force stories I wrote revealed that some Americans struggled to believe the service branch was real .

 Now, most of my decade reporting has been spent covering the Space Force's evolution from Colorado to Capitol Hill .

 📰 I started writing about the military in 2019 at South Carolina's Post and Courier newspaper. ☢️ It was there that I first ran into Colin, who was crushing nuclear national security coverage at the Aiken Standard. If you would've told me then that I'd be his co-worker and covering space warfare ... now, that I wouldn't have believed.

 
 
